; Arcs HIGH mid-flight to clear low walls, lands and spills.
; effect_trigger = 1 (ANY_IMPACT): it spills on an enemy, a wall, OR bare floor
; at the end of its arc - that is what makes it area denial rather than just a
; heavier shot. Aim it at a doorway nobody is standing in.
